    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like \"healing\" though. it just feels like i'm stuck in this loop of misery. everything is just... gray. i feel like i'm just waiting for something that's never coming back. like i'm just a ghost living in his life. it would be so much easier if i didnt have to carry all this weight alone.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
